<section class="relative overflow-hidden border-t border-cream/10 bg-ink-soft">
  <div
    class="glow top-1/3 left-1/2 h-[36rem] w-[36rem] -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/3"
  >
  </div>
  <div class="relative mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 py-28 text-center md:py-40">
    <h2 class="h-section mx-auto max-w-4xl" data-reveal>
      我们用一只并不存在的鸭子,抓住了你的注意力。<br />
      <span class="text-accent">想象一下,当产品是真的,我们能做出什么。</span>
    </h2>
    <div class="mt-10 flex justify-center gap-4" data-reveal>
      <button type="button" class="btn-primary" data-copy-url>复制链接</button>
      <a class="btn-ghost" href="#top">回到顶部</a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <footer class="relative border-t border-cream/10">
    <div
      class="mx-auto flex max-w-7xl flex-col items-center justify-between gap-4 px-6 py-8 md:flex-row"
    >
      <p class="font-mono text-xs text-cream-dim">
        QUACK AI · 用爱与一个(1)token 打造
      </p>
      <p
        class="max-w-xl font-mono text-[0.65rem] leading-relaxed text-cream-dim/70"
      >
        本站是一个虚构的创意项目。QUACK
        并不存在,没有任何商品在售。所有声明均为讽刺,仅供娱乐。
      </p>
    </div>
  </footer>
</section>

<script>
  document
    .querySelector("[data-copy-url]")
    ?.addEventListener("click", async (e) => {
      await navigator.clipboard.writeText(window.location.href);
      const btn = e.currentTarget as HTMLButtonElement;
      btn.textContent = "已复制!";
      setTimeout(() => (btn.textContent = "复制链接"), 1500);
    });
</script>
